### Test de création de signalement corrigé
@baseUrl = https://backend-cleaner-nestjs.onrender.com/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Créer un signalement SANS photo (JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlNDg3YjVjYy0xZGY0LTQ2NTAtYTFmNy1hNzk5ODU5YmUyMjEiLCJlbWFpbCI6Imxvb25hNzc1N0BnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJwaG9uZSI6IisyMzc2OTg3NjU0MzIiLCJyb2xlIjoiQ0lUSVpFTiIsImlhdCI6MTc3NTIwNzAxMSwiZXhwIjoxNzc3MDI3MDg0fQ.VIoEh40HkUevq0CviGCegpbs_XmhDKRXnKZYxqMhv4Q

{
  "bacId": "e487b5cc-1df4-4650-a1f7-a799859be221",
  "reportType": "PLEIN",
  "description": "Le bac est plein et déborde depuis 2 jours",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### 2. Créer un signalement AVEC photo (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlNDg3YjVjYy0xZGY0LTQ2NTAtYTFmNy1hNzk5ODU5YmUyMjEiLCJlbWFpbCI6Imxvb25hNzc1N0BnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJwaG9uZSI6IisyMzc2OTg3NjU0MzIiLCJyb2xlIjoiQ0lUSVpFTiIsImlhdCI6MTc3NTIzODMwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzc3MDUyNzAwfQ.D5r4j9RFaxkwB7jFXlUcTgynGzQhQ5E6YWgs2YKo8hs

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bacId"

f8e12345-0000-4c1d-9e2f-abc123000010
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reportType"

PLEIN
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Le bac est complètement plein et déborde sur la voie publique
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="priority"

HIGH
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test-upload.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-upload.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

